course: dictionary
lesson: 13294
title: Graphics: pictures and designs
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Graphics are pictures, drawings, charts and diagrams, especially ones made on a computer. The words around the word give you clues. «The game has great graphics.» Great graphics must mean the game's pictures look good.
explain: «Our class made posters with computer graphics.» Here graphics are the pictures we made on the screen. Ask yourself: what would fit in this sentence instead? Pictures would fit, so graphics means pictures.
explain: Graphics can also mean the art or skill of making designs, like posters and logos. This is called graphic design. A chart or diagram can be graphics too, because it shows information in a picture.
fact: Graphics means pictures, drawings, charts and diagrams, especially ones made on a computer.
fact: «Good graphics» means the pictures in a game or film look clear and nice.
fact: «Computer graphics» are pictures made with a computer.
fact: Graphic design is the art of making designs and pictures, like posters and logos.
fact: In maths, a graph or chart is a kind of graphics that shows data.
exercise: «The game has great graphics.» What does graphics mean here? | The people who play it | The rules of the game | The sounds in the game | *The pictures in the game
exercise: Which of these is a kind of graphics? | A spoken story read aloud | A song with no words | *A bar chart showing how many pets each child has | A list of names
exercise: Mia is learning graphic design. What is she learning to make? | Music for a school play | *Designs and pictures, like posters and logos | Sums with big numbers | Long stories for books
test: «Computer graphics» are pictures made with what? | A camera | A pencil | A loom | *A computer
test: In a video game, what do the graphics show? | *How the game's pictures look | The name of the game's maker | The number of players who can join | How much the game costs
exam: Tom says, «The film has amazing graphics.» What does Tom mean? | The film is very long | The actors are famous | The music in the film is loud | *The pictures in the film look amazing
